huggorm-bindings carries one file it did not write.

`get-env.sh` is Nix's own script, `src/nix/get-env.sh` in the Nix
source this package links. Nix compiles it into the `nix` binary,
where no library can reach it, so the copy travels verbatim beside
the bindings, from the Nix of the same version.

